WEBVTT

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:02.680
Thank you.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:53.620
with Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.660
Babidi set into motion another one of his sinister schemes.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:01:59.970
Wizards plan.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.350
to draw Piccolo, Trunks, and Goten out of hiding

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:06.610
and feed him to the monster Majin Buu.

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:09.670
But to draw them out, he would first need some faith.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:36.820
At Babini's command, Majin Buu used his power to turn the unsuspecting citizens of an entire city into candy.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:42.760
Then, like a vile vacuum cleaner, he devoured the population in a single gruesome go.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:49.050
How much more of this horror can our heroes bear to witness before they are forced out of hiding?

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:54.290
And how many more victims will Buu have to devour before he satisfies his evil appetite?

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.670
You'll have to watch to find out.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.840
Be courteous and remember that silence is golden.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:39.750
Look at the shame. This city is completely useless if there are no people in it.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.000
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:43.580
Let's fix that.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.240
All these old buildings are spoiling my view.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.970
Go ahead, March and Boo. Clean up this town.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.120
Just don't overdo it. We wouldn't want the whole planet to disappear.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.660
Darn it! He's made his point already!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.980
Now he's just rubbing it in our faces!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:25.060
More like it, they'll do to those three veddlers, too.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:29.030
So one last reminder, it's him.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:30.360
And him.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:31.930
And him.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:36.040
There's really no point in protecting them.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.380
They are not your friends.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.240
They are spineless cowards.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:46.440
If they valued your lives at all, they would have already turned themselves over to me.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:47.980
Obviously, they don't.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.800
Well, shame on them, I say.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.740
You now have an opportunity to teach these selfish brats a lesson.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.530
One chance to stand up for your self-worth and for earthlings everywhere.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:03.730
It's simple, really. Just tell me where they are.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:11.560
Wait, five days to measure the importance of your meager little lives.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.670
Take too long and I'll have Boo annihilate you all.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:23.280
Piccolo, stay calm. Don't let him get to you.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:31.930
There's one more important thing.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.670
You will need to contact me, so I'll tell you how you can.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.200
If you have some information for me, I can hear you.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.070
Start talking and I'll hear you inside my head.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.210
I'm listening, so speak up now.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.650
If you tell me where those uncaring louts are hiding, I might even spare you.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.180
I'm sure they're all here on the list.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.120
Find them!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.960
If we don't, we'll all be turned to...

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:01.890
and eaten by that monster!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.710
Somebody has got to know where those three guys are!

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:05.010
No!

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.010
How do you think I feel?

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.610
I've had my nose buried in these books for a year.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.660
A whole year trying to get into a college

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.340
that just got blown up.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.590
What a gem!

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.210
I could have been at the beach!

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.770
You think that's bad?

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:27.730
Our wedding is tomorrow.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.980
Ever since I was a little girl...

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:31.490
I dreamed of my wedding day.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.790
You're not getting out of this that easy!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:36.640
Sorry, sweetheart!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.540
Someone's already trying to contact me.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.820
Hello, Mr. Babidi, sir.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.120
I was, oh, I'm in charge of the world martial arts tournament

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.960
that was held earlier today.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.100
I hear you.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.840
Those three guys, they were all participants in the competition.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:07:59.740
Excellent.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.490
Are you sure it's them?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:09.690
Oh, their names are Goten, and there's Trugs, and my junior.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:11.390
Yes, that's them.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.110
Listen, I don't care about their names.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:15.950
Just tell me where to find them.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.100
I don't know where they are, sir.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:20.940
You don't know, huh?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.040
Then you're useless to me.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.880
I'm sorry.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.240
Now, don't give me any more useless information.

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.960
Give me what I want, or else.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.930
I can't stand this!

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:55.720
No rest for the wicked.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.440
I've got to keep you humans on your toes,

00:08:58.460 --> 00:08:59.960
so perhaps a little more dis...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.980
We'll keep you all in line

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:10.060
Margin boo. It's time to go. You never know the next place. We visit maybe your hometown

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:14.600
Yes, you can consider this to be your last warning

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:19.510
Remember you have only five days left before we tear this planet apart

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:22.240
Come on give me a call

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.030
Curse him

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.450
That demented wizard

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.740
We've got to stop them.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.860
I don't know if they can be stopped.

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:39.290
So, those are the ones that took Gohan and Vegeta away from us?

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.760
Yeah, Vegeta, Gohan, all those people.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:48.000
And unless we do something quickly for the next five days,

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.400
that list will keep on growing.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.300
There's no way I can allow that to happen.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:53.860
I'll show myself.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.310
No, that won't help anybody, and you know it, Piccolo.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:09:59.970
Bobbini's going...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.490
wipe everyone out no matter what you do stay help me teach goten and trunks the fusion technique

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:14.640
that is the only way we can truly put an end to this nightmare we have five days before the earth

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:24.130
is history we can do it look i know it's hard to sit here doing nothing while he's out there

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:29.630
hurting so many people but you said it yourself we have to be prepared to cope with anything that

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:39.850
Don't worry, okay? We can still revive Majin Buu's victims with the Dragon Balls.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.700
So, just hang in there.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.820
Yes, he's right, Piccolo.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.230
Leave, when you can still do some good here!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.470
I'll stay.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.360
Where am I?

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.370
What a place! What is this?

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:37.930
Hey, Goten! Get up! Goten! Come on, get up!

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:45.020
Darn! Dumb kid sleeps like a rock!

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:49.400
I know! Hey, Goten! Get up, it's time to eat!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.070
Huh? Yes! Eat!

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:55.190
Huh? Food?

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.510
Why do you even have ears?

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:59.750
You hear much better with your stomach!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.320
What did you say? Where is this?

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.340
Uh, I don't know. You tell me.

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.170
I don't know. It's sure nice.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.070
Oh, hey, that plate looks expensive.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.450
Who cares about that? I want to know what we're doing here.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:20.290
Where's my dad?

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.970
Oh, yeah. We were with him.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:23.870
That's right.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.090
Songs, there's something we must know.

00:12:30.732 --> 00:12:32.732
You've made me proud, my son.

00:12:54.476 --> 00:12:56.476
So then he... isn't here?

00:12:56.588 --> 00:12:57.268
Mm-mm.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.260
But I...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.000
I think we should check this place out.

00:13:02.364 --> 00:13:03.084
Mm-hmm.

00:13:32.364 --> 00:13:33.764
This place is huge.

00:13:41.452 --> 00:13:43.092
It looks like there's nobody home.

00:13:47.724 --> 00:13:48.164
Hold on.

00:13:48.428 --> 00:13:50.028
Where have those boys gone?

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:08.620
Kibito.

00:14:09.276 --> 00:14:11.116
Revive Gohan with your power.

00:14:35.564 --> 00:14:36.064
Whoa!

00:14:36.236 --> 00:14:36.736
What the?

00:14:38.316 --> 00:14:38.556
Ugh.

00:14:41.772 --> 00:14:43.112
Supreme Kai, uh...

00:14:44.172 --> 00:14:45.172
Uh, where?

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.000
Uh, are we?

00:14:47.596 --> 00:14:48.636
It's my world.

00:14:49.068 --> 00:14:51.068
It is the world of the Kai's.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.540
This is where you live?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:53.600
Huh!

00:14:54.092 --> 00:14:54.472
Wow.

00:14:54.956 --> 00:14:55.716
I, uh...

00:14:56.236 --> 00:14:58.276
Guess this means I'm dead, doesn't it?

00:15:00.828 --> 00:15:03.348
Hey, I don't get a halo like my dad has.

00:15:03.932 --> 00:15:04.432
No.

00:15:04.604 --> 00:15:05.564
Now don't worry.

00:15:05.788 --> 00:15:06.968
You were in bad shape.

00:15:07.196 --> 00:15:08.056
But you're alive.

00:15:08.636 --> 00:15:09.136
Kay?

00:15:09.532 --> 00:15:12.132
But if I'm not dead, then what am I doing here?

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:15.420
You are asking too many questions of the Supreme Kai.

00:15:16.988 --> 00:15:18.628
You should try to be more respectful.

00:15:19.004 --> 00:15:22.604
You are a guest here. No living mortal has ever stood on this ground.

00:15:24.476 --> 00:15:26.836
Oh, so then I really did die, I guess?

00:15:27.016 --> 00:15:28.556
And that's why I'm here?

00:15:29.404 --> 00:15:29.804
Hmm?

00:15:30.156 --> 00:15:34.056
Gohan, you're alive, but I don't know why you are here.

00:15:34.732 --> 00:15:36.292
It is very strange.

00:15:36.716 --> 00:15:38.716
It is very strange indeed.

00:15:38.956 --> 00:15:40.956
Then what's wrong with asking a few questions?

00:15:41.676 --> 00:15:42.516
Supreme Kai.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:43.860
What's going on?

00:15:44.204 --> 00:15:46.044
I am also puzzled, Master.

00:15:46.956 --> 00:15:47.916
It's not right.

00:15:48.144 --> 00:15:50.544
Gohan does not belong in a place like this.

00:15:53.036 --> 00:15:55.376
I brought Gohan here to get the Z-Sword.

00:15:57.292 --> 00:15:59.952
It's the only way that Majin Buu can be defeated.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.740
Huh?! The Z-Sword?!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:08.070
You... you can't be serious, Supreme Kai!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:11.890
How can a mere Earthling do what the Kais themselves could not?!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.860
Don't you remember?!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:18.700
None of the Kais, not even you, were capable of freeing the Z-Sword!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.780
I'm aware of the power of the Z-Sword.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:26.790
And I'm certain that Gohan is the right person to wield it.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.260
Uh, what's the Z-Sword?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:29.960
Mass-

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.480
Please, have you really thought this through?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.720
There's no harm in trying, Kibito.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.240
Let's go. Gohan, come with me.

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.110
Wait, aren't you gonna tell me what the Z-Sword is?

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:43.910
It's not.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.120
He won't pull the Z-Sword from that rock.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.660
I guarantee it.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:58.860
Good drunks.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:08.830
they? Piccolo, your dad, where are they? Goten, don't you know it's rude to talk with your mouth full?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:18.400
Your manners are really bad. You shouldn't talk when you're eating. I'm sorry. Ah, that's okay.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:23.020
Oh, there you are. Well, I see you found the food.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:36.340
Hey, hands off, buddy!

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:38.740
Goten, what are you doing?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.900
This is no time to be stuffing your face!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.280
Hold on, drunks.

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.760
Please be quiet till I finish my meal.

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:49.870
You were the one that said it was bad manners

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:52.150
to talk when a person was eating, remember?

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.630
If you wanna see bad manners, then you've got it!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:17:59.970
My, even go-

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.180
Goku wasn't that powerful when he was a boy.

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.060
Hey, let's go!

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:04.640
Okay!

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:40.470
To stay right there

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:57.230
Those boys certainly have a lot of energy Goku. Well, I guess I'll have to get them to work it off won't I by teaching them the fusion technique

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:09.220
What a view, you know. In a lot of ways, this reminds me of where I live back on Earth.

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.490
Look at you. This is a sacred place and you're dressed like that.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.690
Those clothes suit you well, Gohan.

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.010
You think so? Thanks.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.680
Ah, this is it. We're here.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.770
This is the Z-Sword, Gohan.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:12.670
Try to pull it out.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.610
No one else has done it.

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.770
Gohan, if you can pull it from the rock, you will be the first.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:20.420
First one, huh?

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:25.920
You know, this might sound strange, but I feel like I've done this before.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:35.830
Never!

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:38.310
No way!

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:39.040
No!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:45.690
That!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.580
Don't have time for this now!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:52.310
We've got a lot of work to do and you'll have to learn some new skills fast!

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:53.810
Ya got it?

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.750
I know that might seem harsh, but there's a chance Babidi could find this place.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.910
So I want both of you to start practicing right away.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:10.110
What about the hyperbolic time chamber?

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.340
No, that room can only be used twice in a lifetime.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.670
I'm sure in the future we're going to have to use it again.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:20.910
We'll be just fine.

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:25.890
If I'm right about these two, they should be able to master the fusion technique in no time.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.240
Now let's begin.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.090
You'll have to learn this pretty quick, too, Piccolo.

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:45.350
Good luck, guys. You're gonna need it.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:51.840
I said stop that! There'll be no more tears from now on!

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:55.400
You will have to be tough to stop Majin Buu!

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:05.130
The news that Gohan and Vegeta were victims of Majin Buu

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:06.730
hit trunks and Goten hard.

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:10.050
Now, they must swallow their pain and channel all of their energies

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.790
into learning the fusion technique.

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:15.120
Little do they know, Gohan is in the other world

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:16.860
preparing for a challenge of his own.

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:20.920
He's got to free the legendary Z-Sword from its resting place,

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:23.830
a feat no one before him has ever accomplished.

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:25.710
Time is running out.

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:29.140
In five days, Majin Buu will destroy the planet.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:29.980
Can be...

00:22:30.090 --> 00:22:31.530
Three warriors save the day?

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.930
Find out on the next Dragon Ball Z.

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:09.160
I'm an angel, so I scatter my tears

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:13.600
I'm the one who erased sadness from this planet

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:19.110
I'll give you a wide blue sky

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:44.200
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:00.680
Take care.
